[[0,1969234,0,1,0,1,"2017-07-01T01:21:19","principle","",[],"","Bizarre Tanker Cooperation Prompts Questions If Qatar, Saudi Feud Is Staged | Zero Hedge","http://www.zerohedge.com/news/2017-06-30/bizarre-tanker-cooperation-prompts-questions-if-qatar-saudi-feud-staged","WorldToday"],[1,9695018,0,0,0,0,"2017-07-01T01:22:24","principle","",[],"<p>Studies spent a fortune on keeping oil price low.</p>"],[1,9696444,0,0,0,0,"2017-07-01T04:00:31","Empire_of_the_mind","",[],"<p>The real story is that the Qatari's bribed the corrupt US government officials to use them to overthrow Syria in order to get a gas pipeline to Europe for the Parsi oil fields. This has caused all kinds of problems and the Saudi's weren't big fans of the move. Now that the corrupt US government has been overthrown by Trump he's given them the greenlight to deal with the Qatari's however they please.</p>"]]
