[[0,1969237,0,1,0,1,"2017-07-01T01:21:49","remedy4reality","",[],"","AMERICA / ENJOY","https://youtu.be/O3fI0mLz3ks?t=51","whatever"],[1,9695109,0,0,1,-1,"2017-07-01T01:31:29","OhRutherfordBehave","",[],"<p>Oz never gave nothing to the tin man...</p>\n<p>honestly that live version was kinda shitty. It was very stale. </p>"],[2,9695146,9695109,0,0,0,"2017-07-01T01:35:35","remedy4reality","",[],"<p>16,643 Likes --- 371 dislikes on 4.5 million views </p>\n<p>We'll drop you in the bin of retards who think this is 'stale'. \r</p>"],[3,9700366,9695146,0,0,0,"2017-07-01T15:43:07","OhRutherfordBehave","",[],"<p>Its completely stale. Open your eyes and ears. </p>"]]
[[0,1969238,0,3,0,3,"2017-07-01T01:22:17","DasReich","",[],"","What's Up With Kikes and Blood?","https://i.imgtc.com/iYPX49y.png","Identitarian"],[1,9695075,0,0,0,0,"2017-07-01T01:27:57","OhRutherfordBehave","",[],"<p>What a fucking freak. </p>"],[1,9695161,0,7,0,7,"2017-07-01T01:36:55","Tzitzimitl","",[],"<p>degeneracy is like water for the jew</p>"],[2,9696235,9695161,0,0,0,"2017-07-01T03:38:11","Red_Lindy","",[],"<p>So succinct </p>"],[1,9695221,0,7,0,7,"2017-07-01T01:43:44","Goater","",[],"<p>I'd be surprised if this wasn't a crime of some sort, particularly if they used the USPS, I know it would be illegal in my country using the national postage service.</p>\n<p>They are sending an unrequested package with potentially dangerous biological material to an unknowing receiver. With the amount of regulation on transport of biological waste and the receiver in question, I'm almost willing to bet on it but I'm sure one of you guys would know.</p>\n<p>Can this woman in turn be accused of inciting said crime. Hope so.</p>"],[2,9696005,9695221,4,0,4,"2017-07-01T03:09:50","Datawych","",[],"<p>Not sure if it's illegal, but it's a biohazard, so probably.</p>"],[2,9697667,9695221,1,0,1,"2017-07-01T07:13:28","ArousedYeti","[e]",[],"<p>Bingo, definitely illegal. </p>\n<p>It is illegal to ship anything soiled with a biological substance.</p>\n<p>But of course democraps are criminals. They don't care whether something is illegal or not.</p>"],[1,9695352,0,1,0,1,"2017-07-01T01:59:04","brandon816","[e]",[],"<p>Look, I'm all for peaceful protest. However, she is totally opening herself up ( by her own code of ethics ) to people mailing dogshit to her. This is just a dumb thing to do in general.</p>"],[1,9695508,0,3,0,3,"2017-07-01T02:15:01","Samsquamch","",[],"<p>If their blood is disease-free and properly registered, it can be mailed. Somehow, I get the feeling that the majority of women who'd like to send their period blood to Trump either won't qualify (Blood is infectious) or they won't properly license and register the package before mailing (&quot;Hi, I'm trying to mail my period blood to the White House, I'd like to register it please&quot;).</p>\n<p>This could end up as felonies for many of the senders; You don't fuck around with government services, including mail services.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://pe.usps.com/text/pub52/pub52c3_010.htm\">https://pe.usps.com/text/pub52/pub52c3_010.htm</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"http://www.slate.com/articles/news_and_politics/explainer/2009/02/blood_mail.html\">http://www.slate.com/articles/news_and_politics/explainer/2009/02/blood_mail.html</a></p>"],[1,9695992,0,0,0,0,"2017-07-01T03:08:37","o0shad0o","",[],"<p>I guess it's in response to Trump's saying her face was bloody, but geez...</p>"],[1,9696384,0,3,0,3,"2017-07-01T03:54:05","ragnnohab","",[],"<p>Good idea, send blood samples. No way the FBI or CIA will be able to determine who that belongs to.</p>"],[1,9697197,0,5,0,5,"2017-07-01T05:50:17","FuckYourSafespace","",[],"<p>This is a biological terrorism threat against the President of the United States, and should be treated as such.</p>"],[1,9697518,0,0,0,0,"2017-07-01T06:46:44","CockroachKing","",[],"<p>Old Testament has a rule about menstrual blood making people ritually impure. Dueteronomy I think.</p>"]]
[[0,1969239,0,2,0,2,"2017-07-01T01:22:39","IraqCombatVet","",[],"","Oh Canada: 5 Games that Celebrate Canada","https://www.goombastomp.com/oh-canada-5-games-that-celebrate-canada/","gaming"],[1,9695266,0,0,0,0,"2017-07-01T01:49:18","C4H9N3O2","",[],"<p><a href=\"http://www.moddb.com/mods/city-7-toronto-conflict\">There's a Half-Life 2 mod that turns City 17 into Toronto.</a></p>\n<p>Plus I'm sure every Civ game has a mod to add Canada as a playable civilization.</p>"]]
[[0,1969240,0,11,1,10,"2017-07-01T01:22:54","HWY__395","",[],"","Hawk or Eagle?","https://i.imgtc.com/4TKOfuz.jpeg","pics2"],[1,9695048,0,10,0,10,"2017-07-01T01:25:12","CANCEL-CAT-FACTS","",[],"<p>Looks like a hawk. There are a lot of them by me and people post a lot of pictures that look like this.</p>"],[2,9695083,9695048,5,0,5,"2017-07-01T01:29:12","HWY__395","",[],"<p>Thanks, I was read somewhere that NYC is s great place for <em>birds of prey</em> to live and hunt.</p>"],[3,9695112,9695083,3,0,3,"2017-07-01T01:32:00","CANCEL-CAT-FACTS","",[],"<p>The young ones make a lot of noise and can be very annoying. The older ones never make noise. They have gigantic wingspans and look like gliders. When they come out and start circling, all of the pigeons fly away.</p>"],[3,9695830,9695083,4,0,4,"2017-07-01T02:50:51","Samsquamch","",[],"<p>I don't have anything for birds of prey, but I do have a video of <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=QaT6EKzKb4k\">&quot;Birds of War&quot;</a></p>"],[4,9695861,9695830,1,0,1,"2017-07-01T02:54:07","HWY__395","[e]",[],"<h1></h1>"],[5,9695891,9695861,1,0,1,"2017-07-01T02:57:12","Samsquamch","",[],"<p>So are those hawks or eagles in the video?</p>"],[6,9695934,9695891,1,0,1,"2017-07-01T03:01:29","HWY__395","",[],"<p>Demz war birds </p>"],[1,9695204,0,4,0,4,"2017-07-01T01:41:53","ditch-digger","",[],"<p>Hawk, easily a hawk.</p>"],[1,9695232,0,7,0,7,"2017-07-01T01:44:49","Givafck","",[],"<p>Red Shouldered Hawk</p>"],[2,9695262,9695232,2,0,2,"2017-07-01T01:48:47","HWY__395","",[],"<p>Really? </p>"],[3,9695276,9695262,3,0,3,"2017-07-01T01:50:21","Givafck","",[],"<p><a href=\"https://birdsna.org/Species-Account/bna/species/reshaw/introduction\">Recon</a></p>"],[4,9695368,9695276,2,0,2,"2017-07-01T02:00:18","HWY__395","",[],"<p>You are correct. Thank you. I'm going too...</p>"],[1,9695383,0,5,0,5,"2017-07-01T02:01:33","Mghorning","",[],"<p>Hawk. Eagles are very big birds. Probably 3 feet from tail to the top of it's head.</p>"],[2,9695553,9695383,1,0,1,"2017-07-01T02:19:30","HWY__395","",[],"<p>I wasn't sure because I heard that there was a few juvenile eagles lurking around near my campground. </p>"],[3,9695562,9695553,2,0,2,"2017-07-01T02:20:34","Mghorning","",[],"<p>Point accepted.</p>"],[1,9695838,0,2,0,2,"2017-07-01T02:51:59","SJWsRuinedIt","",[],"<p>It looks like an autistic hawk. See how he refuses to make eye contact? Buy him a fidget spinner and he'll perk right up.</p>"],[2,9695871,9695838,2,0,2,"2017-07-01T02:54:52","HWY__395","",[],"<p>😂</p>"],[1,9696446,0,2,0,2,"2017-07-01T04:00:45","klobos","",[],"<p>Falcon. </p>"]]
