[[0,1969247,0,2,0,2,"2017-07-01T01:28:07","IraqCombatVet","",[],"","Gaming Headsets Versus Surround Sound Systems","https://greatgaminggalore.wordpress.com/2017/06/11/gaming-headsets-versus-surround-sound-systems/","gaming"],[1,9695301,0,1,0,1,"2017-07-01T01:53:32","J_Darnley","",[],"<p>Unless you are going to share the audio with others in the same room then I think a headset/headphones will be best for nearly everyone. My tips:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Get ones that go completely over your ears. Ones that press down on my ears even slightly leads to large pain after hours and then after taking them off.</li>\n<li>Avoid pleather/fake leather. The grease and oils from your head will rot it and they will shed black flakes.</li>\n</ul>"],[2,9704019,9695301,0,0,0,"2017-07-01T23:14:01","IraqCombatVet","",[],"<p>All good points. I very much prefer gaming headsets to a surround sound system when it comes to video games. But for movies I would prefer a surround sound system for the movie theater like experience.</p>\n<p>Here is a great <a href=\"http://thegizmolife.com/best-gaming-headset/\">guide for gaming headsets</a> that covers a lot of information for those looking to buy.</p>"]]
